hase Soundtracks)</div><div style="font-size:0.75rem;color:#94a3b8;margin-bottom:1rem">เมื่อเปิดใช้งาน Auto-Sync ระบบจะสลับมาเล่นเพลงที่ผูกไว้กับแต่ละช่วงอัตโนมัติ</div><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));gap:0.85rem"><div style="background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);padding:0.9rem;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2)"><div style="font-size:0.82rem;font-weight:700;color:#38bdf8;margin-bottom:0.4rem"><span class="ui-ico-label"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-house lucide-home" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 21v-8a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v8"></path><path d="M3 10a2 2 0 0 1 .709-1.528l7-6a2 2 0 0 1 2.582 0l7 6A2 2 0 0 1 21 10v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path></svg>1. ช่วงพักเวที (Idle / Ambient)</span></div><select style="width:100%;padding:0.55rem;background:#0f172a;border:1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3);border-radius:8px;color:#f8fafc;font-size:0.85rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;color-scheme:dark"><option value="">-- ไม่เปิดเพลง (ปิดเสียง) --</option><option value="preset-ambient-luxury" selected="">Royalty Ambient Pad (ประกายแสงราตรี)</option><option value="preset-spin-tension">Suspense Pulse (ลุ้นระทึกหมุนคำ)</option><option value="preset-question-focus">Focus Chrono Flow (สมาธิคิดคำตอบ)</option><option value="preset-fanfare-royal">Victory Crown Fanfare (เฉลิมฉลองชัยชนะ)</option><option value="custom-1">My Song</option></select></div><div style="background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);padding:0.9rem;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2)"><div style="font-size:0.82rem;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b;margin-bottom:0.4rem"><span class="ui-ico-label"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin