:1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);border-radius:8px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:0.8rem;cursor:pointer">คืนค่าเพลงระบบ (Reset)</button></div></div><div style="border:2px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem;text-align:center;background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);cursor:pointer;margin-bottom:1rem;transition:all 0.2s ease"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-upload" aria-hidden="true" style="margin:0 auto 0.4rem auto"><path d="M12 3v12"></path><path d="m17 8-5-5-5 5"></path><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path></svg><div style="font-size:0.85rem;color:#e2e8f0;font-weight:600">ลากและวางไฟล์เพลง (.mp3, .wav, .ogg) ที่นี่ หรือคลิกเพื่อเลือกไฟล์</div><div style="font-size:0.72rem;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:0.2rem">ไฟล์จะถูกบันทึกลงในเบราว์เซอร์อัตโนมัติ เปิดใช้งานได้แบบออฟไลน์ 100%</div></div><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.5rem"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0.75rem 1rem;background:rgba(28, 32, 70, 0.4);border:1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);border-radius:10px;gap:0.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;flex:1;min-width:220px"><button style="width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);border:none;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;cursor:pointer;flex-shrink:0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play" aria-hidden="true" style="margin-left:2px"><path d="M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z"></path></svg></button><div><div style="font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:600;color:#f8fafc">Royalty Ambi