path><path d="M8 6V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"></path></svg></button></div></td></tr><tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);background:transparent;opacity:1"><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;font-family:monospace;color:#94a3b8;font-size:0.8rem">Q_MIST_01</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#f1f5f9;line-height:1.4">เมื่อต้องเผชิญหน้ากับการตัดสินใจครั้งสำคัญท่ามกลางความคิดเห็นที่แตกต่างและข้อมูลที่คลุมเครือ คุณมีหลักคิดในการค้นหาคำตอบที่ถูกต้องอย่างไร?</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:capitalize">hard</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#94a3b8">attitude</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;text-align:center"><button style="background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;color:#22c55e;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.2rem;font-size:0.75rem"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check-big lucide-check-circle" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335"></path><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"></path></svg><span>เปิด</span></button></td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;text-align:right"><div style="display:inline-flex;gap:0.15rem"><button title="ดูตัวอย่าง (เฉพาะหลังเวที)" style="background:none;border:none;color:#38bdf8;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-eye" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg></button><button title="แก้ไข" style="background:none;border:none;color:#a855f7;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-pen lucide-edit-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.174 6.812a1 1 0 0 0-3.986-3.987L3.842 16.174a2 2 0 0 0-.5.83l-1.321 4.352a.5.5 0 0 0 .623.622l4.353-1.32a2 2 0 0 0 .83-.497z"></path></svg></button><button title="คัดลอก" style="background:none;border:none;color:#cbd5e1;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button><button title="ลบ" style="background:none;border:none;color:#ef4444;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trash lucide-trash-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 11v6"></path><path d="M14 11v6"></path><path d="M19 6v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6"></path><path d="M3 6h18"></path><path d="M8 6V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"></path></svg></button></div></td></tr><tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);background:transparent;opacity:1"><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;font-family:monospace;color:#94a3b8;font-size:0.8rem">Q_MIST_02</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#f1f5f9;line-height:1.4">ในมุมมองของคุณ อะไรคือความแตกต่างระหว่าง &quot;การมองเห็นโอกาส&quot; กับ &quot;การสร้างโอกาส&quot; ให้แก่ผู้ด้อยโอกาสในสังคม?</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:capitalize">hard</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#94a3b8">scenario</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;text-align:center"><button style="background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;color:#22c55e;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.2rem;font-size:0.75rem"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check-big lucide-check-circle" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335"></path><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"></path></svg><span>เปิด</span></button></td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;text-align:right"><div style="display:inline-flex;gap:0.15rem"><button title="ดูตัวอย่าง (เฉพาะหลังเวที)" style="background:none;border:none;color:#38bdf8;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-eye" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg></button><button title="แก้ไข" style="background:none;border:none;color:#a855f7;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-pen lucide-edit-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.174 6.812a1 1 0 0 0-3.986-3.987L3.842 16.174a2 2 0 0 0-.5.83l-1.321 4.352a.5.5 0 0 0 .623.622l4.353-1.32a2 2 0 0 0 .83-.497z"></path></svg></button><button title="คัดลอก" style="background:none;border:none;color:#cbd5e1;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button><button title="ลบ" style="background:none;border:none;color:#ef4444;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trash lucide-trash-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 11v6"></path><path d="M14 11v6"></path><path d="M19 6v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6"></path><path d="M3 6h18"></path><path d="M8 6V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"></path></svg></button></div></td></tr><tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);background:transparent;opacity:1"><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;font-family:monospace;color:#94a3b8;font-size:0.8rem">Q_MIST_03</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#f1f5f9;line-height:1.4">หากต้องเลือกระหว่าง &quot;การพูดความจริงที่เจ็บปวด&quot; กับ &quot;การปลอบใจที่อาจบิดเบือนความจริง&quot; คุณจะเลือกสิ่งใดในฐานะตัวแทนคนรุ่นใหม่?</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:capitalize">hard</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#94a3b8">scenario</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;text-align:center"><button style="background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;color:#22c55e;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.2rem;font-size:0.75rem"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check-big lucide-check-circle" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335"></path><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"></path></svg><span>เปิด</span></button></td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;text-align:right"><div style="display:inline-flex;gap:0.15rem"><button title="ดูตัวอย่าง (เฉพาะหลังเวที)" style="background:none;border:none;color:#38bdf8;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-eye" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg></button><button title="แก้ไข" style="background:none;border:none;color:#a855f7;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-pen lucide-edit-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.174 6.812a1 1 0 0 0-3.986-3.987L3.842 16.174a2 2 0 0 0-.5.83l-1.321 4.352a.5.5 0 0 0 .623.622l4.353-1.32a2 2 0 0 0 .83-.497z"></path></svg></button><button title="คัดลอก" style="background:none;border:none;color:#cbd5e1;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button><button title="ลบ" style="background:none;border:none;color:#ef4444;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trash lucide-trash-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 11v6"></path><path d="M14 11v6"></path><path d="M19 6v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6"></path><path d="M3 6h18"></path><path d="M8 6V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"></path></svg></button></div></td></tr><tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);background:transparent;opacity:1"><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;font-family:monospace;color:#94a3b8;font-size:0.8rem">Q_MIST_04</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#f1f5f9;line-height:1.4">คำวิจารณ์แบบใดที่คุณคิดว่ามีคุณค่าที่สุด และคุณมีเกณฑ์อย่างไรในการแยกแยะระหว่างคำติเพื่อก่อกับคำพูดที่บั่นทอน?</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:capitalize">medium</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#94a3b8">attitude</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;text-align:center"><button style="background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;color:#22c55e;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.2rem;font-size:0.75rem"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check-big lucide-check-circle" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335"></path><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"></path></svg><span>เปิด</span></button></td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;text-align:right"><div style="display:inline-flex;gap:0.15rem"><button title="ดูตัวอย่าง (เฉพาะหลังเวที)" style="background:none;border:none;color:#38bdf8;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-eye" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg></button><button title="แก้ไข" style="background:none;border:none;color:#a855f7;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-pen lucide-edit-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.174 6.812a1 1 0 0 0-3.986-3.987L3.842 16.174a2 2 0 0 0-.5.83l-1.321 4.352a.5.5 0 0 0 .623.622l4.353-1.32a2 2 0 0 0 .83-.497z"></path></svg></button><button title="คัดลอก" style="background:none;border:none;color:#cbd5e1;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button><button title="ลบ" style="background:none;border:none;color:#ef4444;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trash lucide-trash-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 11v6"></path><path d="M14 11v6"></path><path d="M19 6v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6"></path><path d="M3 6h18"></path><path d="M8 6V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"></path></svg></button></div></td></tr><tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);background:rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.02);opacity:0.6"><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;font-family:monospace;color:#94a3b8;font-size:0.8rem">Q_MIST_05</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#f1f5f9;line-height:1.4">คุณมองว่าความไม่สมบูรณ์แบบ (Imperfection) เป็นอุปสรรคหรือเป็นเอกลักษณ์ที่มีเสน่ห์ของมนุษย์?</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:capitalize">medium</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#94a3b8">general</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;text-align:center"><button style="background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;color:#64748b;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.2rem;font-size:0.75rem"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-x lucide-x-circle" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m15 9-6 6"></path><path d="m9 9 6 6"></path></svg><span>ปิด</span></button></td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;text-align:right"><div style="display:inline-flex;gap:0.15rem"><button title="ดูตัวอย่าง (เฉพาะหลังเวที)" style="background:none;border:none;color:#38bdf8;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-eye" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg></button><button title="แก้ไข" style="background:none;border:none;color:#a855f7;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-pen lucide-edit-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.174 6.812a1 1 0 0 0-3.986-3.987L3.842 16.174a2 2 0 0 0-.5.83l-1.321 4.352a.5.5 0 0 0 .623.622l4.353-1.32a2 2 0 0 0 .83-.497z"></path></svg></button><button title="คัดลอก" style="background:none;border:none;color:#cbd5e1;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button><button title="ลบ" style="background:none;border:none;color:#ef4444;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trash lucide-trash-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 11v6"></path><path d="M14 11v6"></path><path d="M19 6v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6"></path><path d="M3 6h18"></path><path d="M8 6V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"></path></svg></button></div></td></tr><tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);background:transparent;opacity:1"><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;font-family:monospace;color:#94a3b8;font-size:0.8rem">Q_MIST_06</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#f1f5f9;line-height:1.4">ถ้าคุณสามารถเปลี่ยนมุมมองหนึ่งเรื่องของคนในสังคมที่มีต่อกลุ่มผู้มีความหลากหลายทางเพศ (LGBTQIAN+) คุณอยากเปลี่ยนเรื่องใดมากที่สุด?</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:capitalize">hard</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#94a3b8">attitude</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;text-align:center"><button style="background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;color:#22c55e;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.2rem;font-size:0.75rem"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check-big lucide-check-circle" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335"></path><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"></path></svg><span>เปิด</span></button></td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;text-align:right"><div style="display:inline-flex;gap:0.15rem"><button title="ดูตัวอย่าง (เฉพาะหลังเวที)" style="background:none;border:none;color:#38bdf8;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-eye" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg></button><button title="แก้ไข" style="background:none;border:none;color:#a855f7;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-pen lucide-edit-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.174 6.812a1 1 0 0 0-3.986-3.987L3.842 16.174a2 2 0 0 0-.5.83l-1.321 4.352a.5.5 0 0 0 .623.622l4.353-1.32a2 2 0 0 0 .83-.497z"></path></svg></button><button title="คัดลอก" style="background:none;border:none;color:#cbd5e1;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button><button title="ลบ" style="background:none;border:none;color:#ef4444;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trash lucide-trash-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 11v6"></path><path d="M14 11v6"></path><path d="M19 6v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6"></path><path d="M3 6h18"></path><path d="M8 6V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"></path></svg></button></div></td></tr><tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);background:transparent;opacity:1"><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;font-family:monospace;color:#94a3b8;font-size:0.8rem">Q_WIND_01</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#f1f5f9;line-height:1.4">หากคุณได้รับเลือกให้ดำรงตำแหน่งนี้ สิ่งแรกที่คุณต้องการใช้เสียงของคุณ (Platform) เป็นกระบอกเสียงเพื่อขับเคลื่อนสังคมคือเรื่องใด และทำไม?</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:capitalize">medium</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#94a3b8">intro</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;text-align:center"><button style="background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;color:#22c55e;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.2rem;font-size:0.75rem"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check-big lucide-check-circle" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335"></path><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"></path></svg><span>เปิด</span></button></td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;text-align:right"><div style="display:inline-flex;gap:0.15rem"><button title="ดูตัวอย่าง (เฉพาะหลังเวที)" style="background:none;border:none;color:#38bdf8;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-eye" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg></button><button title="แก้ไข" style="background:none;border:none;color:#a855f7;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-pen lucide-edit-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.174 6.812a1 1 0 0 0-3.986-3.987L3.842 16.174a2 2 0 0 0-.5.83l-1.321 4.352a.5.5 0 0 0 .623.622l4.353-1.32a2 2 0 0 0 .83-.497z"></path></svg></button><button title="คัดลอก" style="background:none;border:none;color:#cbd5e1;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button><button title="ลบ" style="background:none;border:none;color:#ef4444;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trash lucide-trash-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 11v6"></path><path d="M14 11v6"></path><path d="M19 6v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6"></path><path d="M3 6h18"></path><path d="M8 6V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"></path></svg></button></div></td></tr><tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);background:transparent;opacity:1"><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;font-family:monospace;color:#94a3b8;font-size:0.8rem">Q_WIND_02</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#f1f5f9;line-height:1.4">คุณคิดว่าพลังของคนรุ่นใหม่ (Youth Power) สามารถขับเคลื่อนการเปลี่ยนแปลงเชิงบวกให้กับชุมชนและประเทศได้อย่างไร?</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:capitalize">hard</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#94a3b8">attitude</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;text-align:center"><button style="background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;color:#22c55e;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.2rem;font-size:0.75rem"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check-big lucide-check-circle" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335"></path><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"></path></svg><span>เปิด</span></button></td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;text-align:right"><div style="display:inline-flex;gap:0.15rem"><button title="ดูตัวอย่าง (เฉพาะหลังเวที)" style="background:none;border:none;color:#38bdf8;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-eye" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg></button><button title="แก้ไข" style="background:none;border:none;color:#a855f7;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-pen lucide-edit-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.174 6.812a1 1 0 0 0-3.986-3.987L3.842 16.174a2 2 0 0 0-.5.83l-1.321 4.352a.5.5 0 0 0 .623.622l4.353-1.32a2 2 0 0 0 .83-.497z"></path></svg></button><button title="คัดลอก" style="background:none;border:none;color:#cbd5e1;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button><button title="ลบ" style="background:none;border:none;color:#ef4444;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trash lucide-trash-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 11v6"></path><path d="M14 11v6"></path><path d="M19 6v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6"></path><path d="M3 6h18"></path><path d="M8 6V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"></path></svg></button></div></td></tr><tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);background:transparent;opacity:1"><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;font-family:monospace;color:#94a3b8;font-size:0.8rem">Q_WIND_03</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#f1f5f9;line-height:1.4">หากคุณต้องนำทีมผ่านวิกฤตที่ไม่มีใครเคยเจอมาก่อน คุณจะสร้างความเชื่อมั่นและรักษาพลังใจของทีมไว้ได้อย่างไร?</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:capitalize">hard</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;color:#94a3b8">scenario</td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;text-align:center"><button style="background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;color:#22c55e;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.2rem;font-size:0.75rem"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check-big lucide-check-circle" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335"></path><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"></path></svg><span>เปิด</span></button></td><td style="padding:0.75rem 1rem;text-align:right"><div style="display:inline-flex;gap:0.15rem"><button title="ดูตัวอย่าง (เฉพาะหลังเวที)" style="background:none;border:none;color:#38bdf8;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-eye" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg></button><button title="แก้ไข" style="background:none;border:none;color:#a855f7;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-pen lucide-edit-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.174 6.812a1 1 0 0 0-3.986-3.987L3.842 16.174a2 2 0 0 0-.5.83l-1.321 4.352a.5.5 0 0 0 .623.622l4.353-1.32a2 2 0 0 0 .83-.497z"></path></svg></button><button title="คัดลอก" style="background:none;border:none;color:#cbd5e1;cursor:pointer;padding:0.45rem;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke